---
manual: list_box.choose_style
lines: [3199, 3202]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  para "Choose a fruit:"
  list_box items: ["Grapes", "Pears", "Apricots"],
    width: 120, choose: "Apricots" do |list|
      @fruit.text = list.text
  end

  @fruit = para "No fruit selected"
end
----------- test code
refute_equal "Apricots", list_box.items.first, "so the choice cannot come from a first-item default"
assert_equal "Apricots", list_box.text, ":choose highlights that item from the beginning"
